msgstr ""
"Escolha uma pasta existente na qual o KOReader tenha permissão de escrita e "
"tente novamente a transferência."

#: lua/localsend_diagnostics.lua:1222 lua/localsend_diagnostics.lua:1558
msgid "Choose folder"
msgstr "Escolher pasta"

#: lua/localsend_diagnostics.lua:1228
msgid "The LocalSend receiver could not start"
msgstr "O recetor do LocalSend não conseguiu arrancar"

#: lua/localsend_diagnostics.lua:1229
msgid ""
"The receiver did not answer on this device. The backend log may explain why."
msgstr ""
"O recetor não respondeu neste dispositivo. O backend log pode explicar o "
"motivo."

#: lua/localsend_diagnostics.lua:1231
msgid "View log"
msgstr "Ver log"

#: lua/localsend_diagnostics.lua:1237
msgid "LocalSend could not open its network port"
msgstr "O LocalSend não conseguiu abrir a sua porta de rede"

#: lua/localsend_diagnostics.lua:1238
msgid "This device could not allow LocalSend through its firewall on port %1."
msgstr ""
"Este dispositivo não conseguiu permitir o LocalSend através da firewall na "
"porta %1."

#: lua/localsend_diagnostics.lua:1240 lua/localsend_diagnostics.lua:1574
msgid "View details"
msgstr "Ver detalhes"

#: lua/localsend_diagnostics.lua:1245
msgid "LocalSend is ready on this device"
msgstr "O LocalSend está pronto neste dispositivo"

#: lua/localsend_diagnostics.lua:1247
msgid ""
"The receiver starts correctly and the save folder is writable. If another "
